// TEST: fold kernel of a reduction join leg writes (rejects)
// ERROR: BL4005 @ 10:1
// ERROR-CONTAINS: a leg of this join writes a captured binding
// Gap G43. One leg's FOLD kernel writes the captured `G` and the other leg's
// map reads it: the legs fold side by side, so what the reader sees depends on
// the join's internal schedule: the compiled lanes interleaved the legs per
// cell (r = 612.0), the interpreter ran them one after another (r = 615.0).
